**Timezone Considerations:**

Mobile devices may be in different timezones. Consider using UTC:

```js
// Get UTC date
const utcDate = new Date();
const utcISO = app.dataFormatter.convertDatetoISO(
    new Date(utcDate.getTime() + utcDate.getTimezoneOffset() * 60000)
);
```

**Debugging Mobile Filters:**

Enable detailed logging to see filter application:

```js
onDatasourceInitialized(datasource, owner, app) {
    if (datasource.name === 'myDS') {
        const filter = {/* your filter */};

        // Log before applying
        this.app.log.d(TAG, `Applying filter: ${JSON.stringify(filter)}`);

        datasource.updateBaseQuery({"mobileQbeFilter": filter});

        // Log datasource state
        this.app.log.d(TAG, `Datasource query: ${JSON.stringify(datasource.baseQuery)}`);
    }
}
```

**Testing Offline Mode:**

1. Load data while connected
2. Enable airplane mode
3. Navigate to filtered page
4. Verify filter works on local data
5. Check console for any errors
